OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be a mainly dry day
OL,6,Fwith variable amounts of cloud and
OL,7,Fsome bright or sunny spells. Chance of
OL,8,Fa few showers in the east.
OL,9,
OL,10,CTonight:FIt will be a largely dry and
OL,11,Fclear evening and night with a
OL,12,Fwidespread sharp frost. A few showers
OL,13,Fcontinuing across Buchan. Light and
OL,14,Fvariable winds.
OL,15,
OL,16,CSaturday:FAfter a frosty start many
OL,17,Fplaces will have a dry day with plenty
OL,18,Fof sunshine. Still one or two showers
OL,19,Facross Buchan.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
